        "content": "import lvgl as lv\nimport ui\n\n# FTP SERVER: the files of the board for a PC on the same WiFi network. The server is in\n# ftp_server, the screen in ftp_app; the timer polls the server every 20 ms, so the screen keeps\n# its pace during a long copy. The network is one of those saved by the Settings example.\n\nimport cac_settings\n\n\n# --- English and Italian, with the language chosen in the Settings app --------------------\nIT = {\n    'FTP Server': 'Server FTP',\n    'Serving': 'Attivo',\n    'ADDRESS': 'INDIRIZZO',\n    'ftp://192.168.1.50   on Home': 'ftp://192.168.1.50   su Casa',\n    'USER': 'UTENTE',\n    'mpy': 'mpy',\n    'PASSWORD': 'PASSWORD',\n    'New password': 'Nuova password',\n    'THE CLIENTS SEE': 'I CLIENT VEDONO',\n    'Flash and SD card\\nSD card\\nStudio apps': 'Flash e scheda SD\\nScheda SD\\nApp di Studio',\n    'No one connected': 'Nessuno connesso',\n    'No transfer': 'Nessun trasferimento',\n    'Received 0 B    Sent 0 B': 'Ricevuti 0 B    Inviati 0 B',\n    'STORAGE': 'MEMORIA',\n    '   on %s': '   su %s',\n    'Connecting to the WiFi...': 'Mi connetto al WiFi...',\n    'No WiFi: add a network with the Settings app': \"Niente WiFi: aggiungi una rete con l'app Settings\",\n    '%s free of %s': '%s liberi su %s',\n    'Connected: %s': 'Connessi: %s',\n    'Stopped': 'Fermo',\n    'Sending': 'Invio',\n    'Receiving': 'Ricevo',\n    'Received %s    Sent %s': 'Ricevuti %s    Inviati %s',\n    'Simulator': 'Simulatore',\n    'Error %s': 'Errore %s',\n    'Waiting': 'In attesa',\n    'Flash and SD card': 'Flash e scheda SD',\n    'Studio apps': 'App di Studio',\n    'SD card': 'Scheda SD',\n}\nt = cac_settings.translator(IT)    # t(\"English text\"): the text in the language of the board\n_translated = False\n\n\ndef translate_once():\n    \"\"\"The texts of the pages, written in English in the designer, in the language of the board.\"\"\"\n    global _translated\n    if not _translated:\n        _translated = True\n        cac_settings.translate(ui, IT)\n\nimport ftp_app\n\ndef server_screen_loaded(e):\n    translate_once()\n    ftp_app.start(ui)\n\ndef tick_tick(e):\n    ftp_app.tick()\n\ndef serve_switch_value_changed(e):\n    ftp_app.serve_changed(e.get_target_obj())\n\ndef new_password_button_clicked(e):\n    ftp_app.new_password()\n\ndef folder_value_changed(e):\n    ftp_app.folder_changed(e.get_target_obj())\n"
